# Contracts SSOT + codegen: pin LF so the GENERATED Go/TS/Python blobs stay
# byte-identical on every platform and the codegen-drift gate is deterministic
# regardless of a developer's core.autocrlf. The generators (tools/*.mjs) always
# emit LF; these attributes make the committed blobs and checkouts match that.
# Covers BOTH IDL kinds now co-located under contracts/: the cloudproviders YAML
# and the folded molecule-contracts JSON-Schema contracts + their gen/ bindings.
contracts/** text eol=lf
gen/** text eol=lf
tools/** text eol=lf
tests/test_cloudproviders_contract.py text eol=lf
.gitea/workflows/contracts-codegen-drift.yml text eol=lf
